    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "This index provides a way to navigate the project through its major people, concepts, and annotation tags. It is designed to help viewers move through the "
        },
        {
          "text": "To Tell the Truth",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": " segment by theme rather than only by video chronology."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The project’s tags are organized into several groups: "
        },
        {
          "text": "Structure",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Event",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Interaction",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Credibility",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Media",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "People",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaze",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Face",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", and "
        },
        {
          "text": "Body",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ". These groups help identify different layers of the video, from the program’s structure and the Pascagoula event narrative to the facial expressions, gestures, and media framing that shape how credibility is performed and judged."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Viewers can use the index to locate repeated themes such as "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mediated Testimony",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Credibility Performance",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Truth Test",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Humor Disbelief",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Signed Statement",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Panel Questioning",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eye Movement",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ", and "
        },
        {
          "text": "Facial Seriousness",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ". These tags connect moments across the video and show how the segment turns Hickson’s written account into a public game show evaluation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "This page works together with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Guide to Tags",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ". The Guide to Tags explains what each tag means, while the index helps viewers find where those tags appear in the annotated video."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
